    "enUS": {
      "description": "Swift, and clever, Brumeran glides silently across the snowy landscape of southern Winterspring. But do not let her graceful appearance convince you that she is harmless. All that cross her pay considerably, and often with their own lives.\n\nSeek out Brumeran of the chillwind among the chimera. Defeat her, then return again to me.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
